ble - MelanX\nfixed extra drop on hitting entity - MelanX\nupdate to 2.0.1 - MelanX\nremoved resourcepacks - MelanX\nfixed pack.mcmeta resolution - MelanX\nfixed pack icon - MelanX\nCreate preview.png - MelanX\nMerge pull request #19 from MelanX/imgbot - MelanX\n[ImgBot] Optimize images - ImgBotApp\nadded Sphax patches - MelanX\nMerge pull request #17 from TheDirectorX/russian-localization-for-1.15.2 - MelanX\nsimplified a bit - MelanX\nUpdate ru_ru.json - DirectorX\nfixed some items not dropping extra stuff - MelanX\ntry if that fixes the permanantly update icon - MelanX\nMerge pull request #15 from TheDirectorX/russian-localization-for-1.15.2 - MelanX\nAdded ru_ru.json - DirectorX\nchanged version to 2.0 - MelanX\nadded tags for tools - MelanX\nadded more tags + entities - MelanX\nfixed en_us.json - MelanX\nchanged to lib config - MelanX\nchanged to lib tags + auto smelt - MelanX\nchanegd a lot for languages - MelanX\nchanged to libs damage source - MelanX\nre-added events - MelanX\nremoved ToolUtil - MelanX\nadded library mod as dependency - MelanX\n1.4 build - MelanX\nre-added paper cut text - MelanX\nadded new materials to more damage and head drops - MelanX\nadded auto smelt to other fiery tools - MelanX\nit finally works with pickaxe - MelanX\nfixed a crash - MelanX\nShould work now, just fixed out of the bed - MelanX\nadded auto-smelt for fiery pick - MelanX\nupdated forge and mappings - MelanX\nmore damage for more tools - MelanX\noptimized a few imports - MelanX\nadded enchantments to lang - MelanX\nbalanced tool values - MelanX\nwhy it wasn't added last time? bruh.. - MelanX\nlooks better - MelanX\ngenerated new data - MelanX\nfixed item group name - MelanX\nadded textures for new materials - MelanX\nfixed languages - MelanX\nbasically added new tools - MelanX\nalphabetic order now - MelanX\nadded new jsons - MelanX\nremoved old jsons - MelanX\nadded data creators - MelanX\nchanged way of registration - MelanX\nchanged item tier \"generation\" - MelanX\nmade available for 1.15.2 - MelanX\nfacepalm - MelanX\nCreate README.md - MelanX\nupdate to 1.3.3 - MelanX\nchanged repair item to use tags and rebalanced obsidian and emerald durability and emerald enchantability - MelanX\ndump version to 1.3.2 - MelanX\nadded enchantment description for other mods - MelanX\nreranged the code - MelanX\nJEI is here - MelanX\nbump version to 1.3.1 - MelanX\nadded efficiency support HYPE - MelanX\nport to 1.15.1 - MelanX\nport to 1.15 - MelanX\nchanges for different version marking - MelanX\nupdated update link - MelanX\nadded enchantment - MelanX\nbump version to 1.2 - MelanX\nFixed every hoe type makes damage - MelanX\nmade german lang file more like vanilla - MelanX\nchanged versions - MelanX\nrenamed creative tab - MelanX\nfixed max paper damage is 1 to low - MelanX\nfixed double ore drop not configurable - MelanX\nFixed version shown as NONE +bumped version to 1.1 - MelanX\nprevent spamming a bit - MelanX\nharvestlevel and durability configurable - MelanX\npaper damage amount configurable - MelanX\nfixed #3 - MelanX\nbumped version to 1.0 - MelanX\nAdded (polished) granite/andesite/diorite as ingredient for stone tools - MelanX\nadded jei as dep (dev only) - MelanX\nConfig should be fixed now - MelanX\nre-textured all tools - MelanX\nimproved check for silk touch - MelanX\ndamage by paper tools added - MelanX\nbasically added paper tools - MelanX\nadded config - MelanX\ndrops feature added - MelanX\nFixed bone sword/axe reduce damage in some cases - MelanX\nUpdate to 0.2 - MelanX\ncompressed textures - MelanX\nadded bone tools - MelanX\nstuff for first release - MelanX\nbalanced speed/damage stuff - MelanX\nadded emerald + quartz - MelanX\noptimized images to reduce size - MelanX\nadded glowstone and coal tools - MelanX\nfirst the materials added - MelanX"
